  "markdown": "The Wallcovering Guide · Choose and source\n\n# Élitis\n\nÉlitis offers wallpapers, wallcoverings and fabrics exploring woven, vinyl, textile and handcrafted surfaces. Its official guidance separates retailer enquiries, professional representatives and swatch requests. Product availability access is restricted to its professional extranet.\n\n## Source evidence\n\nRead the maker’s information for the selected product and destination. A brand profile does not certify a seller or prove that an order will be accepted.\n\n- [Official source](https://elitis.fr/en/collections/walls?qa=new) — checked 2026-10-17\n- [Official source](https://elitis.fr/en/expertise/our-signature) — checked 2026-10-17\n- [Official source](https://elitis.fr/en/faq) — checked 2026-10-17\n- [Official source](https://elitis.fr/en/retail-outlets/london-showroom) — checked 2026-10-17\n\n[Visit maker website](https://elitis.fr/en/)\n\n## Official sourcing routes\n\nCheck the route’s scope before ordering. Showrooms, samples and finder links do not establish a roll checkout or delivery promise.\n\n### Showroom or brand contact\n\nView collections or use the listed showroom contact to enquire.\n\n**Region**\n: United Kingdom — London\n\n**UK access**\n: A UK physical contact route is evidenced; delivery terms are not.\n\n**Overseas access**\n: Not established; ask the maker about the selected destination.\n\nMaker-published information; confirm current eligibility and destination before ordering.\n\nTerms and checks before ordering\n\nAccount eligibility, direct retail ordering and sample costs: not established; ask the maker.\n\nOfficial page checked 2026-10-17. Website evidence, not a test order.\n\n[Open official source](https://elitis.fr/en/retail-outlets/london-showroom)\n\n### Find a stockist or representative\n\nUse the FAQ’s Retailers link to find a showroom/retailer; professionals are directed to their country agent/distributor.\n\n**Region**\n: Country-dependent; international\n\n**UK access**\n: UK visitors can use the London route; an international finder does not establish UK shipping.\n\n**Overseas access**\n: Not established; ask the maker about the selected destination.\n\nMaker-published information; confirm current eligibility and destination before ordering.\n\nTerms and checks before ordering\n\nProfessionals: country representative route. Private individuals: direct contact permitted. Online availability requires professional extranet access.\n\nOfficial page checked 2026-10-17. Website evidence, not a test order.\n\n[Open official source](https://elitis.fr/en/faq)\n\n### Samples\n\nFollow the product-reference swatch request described by the FAQ, or ask a retailer.\n\n**Region**\n: Website; delivery territory not stated\n\n**UK access**\n: UK sample fulfilment not verified.\n\n**Overseas access**\n: Not established; ask the maker about the selected destination.\n\nMaker-published information; confirm current eligibility and destination before ordering.\n\nTerms and checks before ordering\n\nFAQ describes an online swatch action. Charges, eligibility and UK sample delivery: not established; ask the maker.\n\nOfficial page checked 2026-10-17. Website evidence, not a test order.\n\n[Open official source](https://elitis.fr/en/faq)\n\n[All makers](https://www.mrwallcover.com/makers/)\n\n## From sample to specification\n\nRecord the exact design and product code, check current instructions and establish the wall preparation before quantities and installation are agreed.\n\n[Discuss your wallcovering](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/?intent=source)\n\nBy [Dorin Burcus](https://www.mrwallcover.com/about/#dorin), founder · Last updated 18 October 2026\n",
